      "content": "Hey, quick question. I'm looking at some data from a Finno-Ugric language and I'm having trouble parsing these specific agglutinative forms. Could you help me break down the morpheme structure for the following words? I need to see the root and the individual suffixes, and also note if there are any morphophonemic changes happening at the boundaries.\n\nWords:\n1. talossani\n2. kirjakauppiaat\n3. evänkö",
